You handed me a pig.

00:00:06.445 --> 00:00:09.214
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.214 --> 00:00:12.461
A producer here wants to make me smile.

00:00:12.461 --> 00:00:13.957
Good (bleep) luck.

00:00:13.957 --> 00:00:15.746
- Oh God, this is like that game I played

00:00:15.746 --> 00:00:18.973
as a kid like I love you
honey but I just can't smile.

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:21.405
- I smiled once, I hated it.

00:00:21.405 --> 00:00:23.325
- I'm already smiling so I don't think

00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:26.075
I'm going to be too good at this.

00:00:28.132 --> 00:00:29.689
From here on out I'm about to press

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:32.356
