00:00:33.974 --> 00:00:36.215
(laughing)

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:38.465
And I'm not going to smile.

00:00:40.815 --> 00:00:43.982
(light upbeat music)

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.152
- This is adorable.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.764
- I actually feel dirty that I wasn't

00:00:54.764 --> 00:00:56.362
able to express those emotions.

00:00:56.362 --> 00:00:58.443
Like if they have blue
balls for your heart,

00:00:58.443 --> 00:00:59.833
I've got blue balls of the heart.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.551
- Very cute, didn't smile.

00:01:01.551 --> 00:01:02.384
Nailed it.

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:05.779
This better not be a clown.

00:01:14.266 --> 00:01:15.620
Why did you bring children?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.358
- Hey man, how's it going?

00:01:17.358 --> 00:01:18.227
- What's your name?

00:01:18.227 --> 00:01:19.060
- Blake.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.560
- Blake, and what's your name?

00:01:22.627 --> 00:01:23.460
Also Blake?

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.706
- Oh man you got me.

00:01:25.706 --> 00:01:29.873
Remember, I'm not angry I'm
just trying not to smile.

00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:32.341
How many software engineers does

00:01:32.341 --> 00:01:34.343
it take to install a light bulb?

00:01:34.343 --> 00:01:35.176
- One.

00:01:35.176 --> 00:01:37.843
- No zero because it's hardware.

00:01:39.522 --> 00:01:41.939
You don't get that one, nope?

00:01:45.846 --> 00:01:48.321
- Which house is another house?

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:52.146
- I don't know which
house is another house?

00:01:52.146 --> 00:01:53.146
- My houses.

00:01:58.276 --> 00:02:00.943
- I don't know what's happening.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.030
Has this happened with every person?

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.696
- How's your day?

00:02:05.696 --> 00:02:06.968
He just left me.

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:08.477
- Thank you for the hug.

00:02:08.477 --> 00:02:11.397
That was very nice of you.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.219
- Of course a kid is
going to make me smile.

00:02:13.219 --> 00:02:14.938
I didn't understand his jokes but

00:02:14.938 --> 00:02:16.691
