00:02:23.587 --> 00:02:27.087
- I will never smile, I have never smiled.

00:02:30.315 --> 00:02:31.148
- Put your hands up a little bit.

00:02:31.148 --> 00:02:32.898
- What is that sound?

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:35.710
- What is this?

00:02:44.221 --> 00:02:46.550
Its little snout is tiny.

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:51.196
