so I can look at his face?

00:02:51.196 --> 00:02:52.268
Oh but he's pooping.

00:02:52.268 --> 00:02:53.112
- Where can I scratch?

00:02:53.112 --> 00:02:55.362
Do you like a butt scratch?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.827
- God damn it, Eric.

00:03:01.882 --> 00:03:05.812
Try to make me, (bleep) you (bleep)

00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:08.652
it's (bleep) pooping on me.

00:03:08.652 --> 00:03:10.289
Of course I'm going to smile it's adorable

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:12.963
little baby pig that just
shat all over my arm.

00:03:12.963 --> 00:03:15.705
- When I scratched her butt
her leg did this thing.

00:03:15.705 --> 00:03:19.089
- Cute little puppies and
then adorable little kids

00:03:19.089 --> 00:03:22.877
with hugs, even a little tea
cup pig can't get me but,

00:03:22.877 --> 00:03:25.666
