00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:28.333
- Just laugh, life is too short.

00:03:29.345 --> 00:03:30.937
Come here, come here lady.

00:03:30.937 --> 00:03:32.678
- Has he pooped on everyone?

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:33.511
Just me?

00:03:34.745 --> 00:03:38.861
Eric you got me to smile,
you did it, you mad genius.

00:03:38.861 --> 00:03:42.194
Nope nope that's not food, there you go.

